1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,001
A teammate is waiting for your idea.

2
00:00:03,001 --> 00:00:06,473
You open a diagramming tool and it asks you

3
00:00:06,473 --> 00:00:08,016
to sign up first.

4
00:00:08,016 --> 00:00:10,331
You only wanted a blank canvas.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,226
Excalidraw is an open source whiteboard that turns rough

6
00:00:15,226 --> 00:00:17,407
sketches into hand-drawn style diagrams,

7
00:00:17,407 --> 00:00:20,025
with no sign-up in the way.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,997
Open excalidraw.com and the canvas is already blank.

9
00:00:24,997 --> 00:00:27,495
No sign-up screen, no setup,

10
00:00:27,495 --> 00:00:28,993
just a toolbar.

11
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,330
Choose the text tool.

12
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:35,813
Rectangles, arrows, sticky notes and an eraser sit right beside it.

13
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,298
Click anywhere on the canvas.

14
00:00:38,298 --> 00:00:41,015
A text cursor appears right where you clicked,

15
00:00:41,015 --> 00:00:42,713
ready for your first word.

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,606
Type a line and it lands on the canvas

17
00:00:46,606 --> 00:00:47,986
in a hand-drawn font.

18
00:00:47,986 --> 00:00:50,057
Your drawing autosaves in the browser.

19
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:55,965
The open source repo has 135,932 GitHub stars.

20
00:00:55,965 --> 00:00:59,838
381 contributors have helped build it.

21
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,020
Try it at excalidraw.com.
